{"data":{"id":"3TcVK9VShJg","slug":"baatin","title":"Baatin","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"brPaS54iBJs","slug":"magic-instrumental","title":"Magic (instrumental)"},{"id":"OSoYYXzNes0","slug":"joy","title":"Joy"},{"id":"3wXTHg21ud4","slug":"good-life","title":"Good Life"}]},"markers":[{"id":"36ht3ltWwaY","position":41,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Baatin - Magic (instrumental)","track":{"id":"brPaS54iBJs","path":"/artists/baatin/tracks/magic-instrumental/","slug":"magic-instrumental","title":"Magic (instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"baatin","title":"Baatin"},"artwork":"images/artists/baatin/tracks/magic-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"zhe9GES87RY","position":12,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Baatin - Joy","track":{"id":"OSoYYXzNes0","path":"/artists/baatin/tracks/joy/","slug":"joy","title":"Joy","artist":{"slug":"baatin","title":"Baatin"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9uuATI0cyb4","slug":"149","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-149-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #149 w/ House Shoes","artwork":"/images/episodes/149.jpg","content":"\nThe pioneer/legendary House Shoes kicks off exclusives from label Street Corner Music.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThis man's musical selections, experiences/knowledge, and blunt personality is one that you can't deny. \n\nWe respect House Shoes! It was nice to finally have him come by and drop two different sets (that's right two!). \n\nHe kicked it off with exclusives from his new label Street Corner Music and then ended with some nice soulful joints. \n\nJoe Kay's discussion with Shoes also touched on many great subjects that many of you wanted to know. Enjoy.\n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10822,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"House Shoes' Set part 2","position":3}},{"id":"X4V6fbTkxEk","position":13,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Baatin - Good Life","track":{"id":"3wXTHg21ud4","path":"/artists/baatin/tracks/good-life/","slug":"good-life","title":"Good Life","artist":{"slug":"baatin","title":"Baatin"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9uuATI0cyb4","slug":"149","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-149-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #149 w/ House Shoes","artwork":"/images/episodes/149.jpg","content":"\nThe pioneer/legendary House Shoes kicks off exclusives from label Street Corner Music.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThis man's musical selections, experiences/knowledge, and blunt personality is one that you can't deny. \n\nWe respect House Shoes! It was nice to finally have him come by and drop two different sets (that's right two!). \n\nHe kicked it off with exclusives from his new label Street Corner Music and then ended with some nice soulful joints. \n\nJoe Kay's discussion with Shoes also touched on many great subjects that many of you wanted to know. Enjoy.\n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10822,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"House Shoes' Set part 2","position":3}},{"id":"VgigIdJ8qxI","position":25,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Baatin - Magic (instrumental)","track":{"id":"brPaS54iBJs","path":"/artists/baatin/tracks/magic-instrumental/","slug":"magic-instrumental","title":"Magic (instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"baatin","title":"Baatin"},"artwork":"images/artists/baatin/tracks/magic-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"laWaR2BCPmc","slug":"185","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-185-w-fortune"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #185 w/ Fortune","artwork":"/images/episodes/185.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10764,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-08-30T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"kaxFG2vCFDY","position":25,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Baatin - Magic (instrumental)","track":{"id":"brPaS54iBJs","path":"/artists/baatin/tracks/magic-instrumental/","slug":"magic-instrumental","title":"Magic (instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"baatin","title":"Baatin"},"artwork":"images/artists/baatin/tracks/magic-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"laWaR2BCPmc","slug":"185","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-185-w-fortune"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #185 w/ Fortune","artwork":"/images/episodes/185.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10764,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-08-30T01:00:00+00:00